### 变异

只在 `/private/tmp/card-g56c-r9-mut.eB9MLG` 隔离副本执行：

```sh
python3 -B _bmad-output/审查/evidence-g56c/g56c_mutations.py \
  /private/tmp/card-g56c-r9-mut.eB9MLG
```

逐字结果：

```text
